🟢 LayeredControlNFT-v1: The Custom Standard
Standard Overview

The LayeredControlNFT-v1 standard is designed for NFTs that support:

    Multiple layered media (GLB/3D, video, audio, images)

    Explicit z-ordering and control types

    On-chain/off-chain compatibility with OpenSea, Solana/Metaplex, etc.

    Interactive controls for moving, rotating, or otherwise manipulating layers

    Arbitrary future extension (new media types, input methods, etc.)

Required Fields
Field	Type	Required?	Description
nft_standard	string	Yes	Set to "LayeredControlNFT-v1"
name	string	Yes	NFT display name
description	string	Yes	NFT description
image	string	Yes	Static preview (URL, usually IPFS, PNG/JPG)
animation_url	string	Optional	Video/audio/HTML (for animated or interactive display)
layers	array	Yes	List of layered assets (see below)
attributes	array	Optional	NFT traits
controls	object	Optional	Declares what’s interactive, grabbable, etc.
LayeredControlNFT-v1: Layer Definition

Each item in layers is an object:
Field	Type	Required?	Example Value	Description
type	string	Yes	"background", "foreground"	Logical position
z_index	int	No	1, 2, 3	Draw order (higher is on top)
media_type	string	Yes	"model/gltf-binary"	MIME type
