🧩 Key Fields Explained
Field	Type	Required	Description
nft_standard	string	Yes	Set to "LayeredControlNFT-v1"
name	string	Yes	NFT display name
description	string	Yes	NFT description
image	string	Yes	Static preview (URL or IPFS)
animation_url	string	Optional	Video/audio/HTML for animated view
layers	array	Yes	List of layered assets
attributes	array	Optional	NFT traits
controls	object	Optional	Global interaction settings

Layer Objects:

Field	Type	Required	Description
type	string	Yes	"background", "foreground", "audio", etc.
z_index	int	No	Draw order (higher = on top)
media_type	string	Yes	MIME type, e.g., "model/gltf-binary"
label	string	No	Human-readable layer name
url	string	Yes	Asset location (IPFS/URL)
init	object	No	Initial x/y/size/rotation, etc.
controls	object	No	Layer-level interactivity

